# The users and groups Voltaic owns (#417 S3, #457): voltaic.json, generated by
# rust/tools/nixos-users from its modsys modules and checked against them by that crate's
# `cargo test`. Do not edit the JSON; edit rust/tools/nixos-users/src/fragments.vlt and
# regenerate (`cargo run -q > ../../../features/nixos/users/voltaic.json` in the crate).
#
#   fragments.<name>  what one feature contributes, in the shape of NixOS's `users` option
#                     (`{ users = { <name> = {…}; }; groups = {…}; }`), so a feature writes
#                     `users = voltaic.fragments.<name>;` and keeps its own gating.
#   operator          the operator account's record, without the parts that come from the
#                     host settings (name, home, full name, initial password).
#
# Plain data, no options: importing this file changes no host by itself.
builtins.fromJSON (builtins.readFile ./voltaic.json)
